t2 ?

In VAP {
  First analysis {
      Execute an ODP.
      This ODP results in incomplete naming, we only have the name of operators but not their parameter's types.
      We don't know the types of the elements yet, we only split by operator symbols and reformat the ZCI with function calls.
  }

  Second analysis {
      Litteral values and optionnally shortcut notations of common structures are processed under the rules of the ZPL.
  }

  Last discreet step : Complete the names of operators in ODP as we are now able to know each parameter type.
}
